# TwichUI project instructions

Before inspecting or modifying this project, read the root CLAUDE.md.
Its instructions apply regardless of which assistant is used.

Edit only the TwichUI development repository.
Treat reference addons and wow-ui-source as read-only.

Preserve user settings, saved pins, kept-pin protection, and Chronicle data.
Verify WoW: Forever APIs rather than assuming Retail behavior.

Follow requested planning/approval checkpoints.
Do not commit, deploy, publish, or change release metadata unless requested.

Report actual file changes, checks performed, and remaining in-game tests.
Never present suggestions or unperformed tests as completed work.